# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored: committing it is what makes
# provider resolution reproducible across machines and CI. Without it, the same
# `terraform validate` can pass locally and fail in CI on a different provider.
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

